/*
 * Implements semantic validation for enum declarations.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of enum type annotations,
 *   - validation of enum field values,
 *   - type inference for untyped enums,
 *   - detection of forward-reference cycles,
 *   - construction of EnumType generator values,
 *   - error aggregation for invalid fields,
 *   - memory-ownership verification for enum values.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
